[I] Slightly less simple wayland compositor library

[T] neuswc is a fork of swc created by wayland.fyi. it provides an easy C
[T] library interface to make a wayland compositor. it is much smaller than
[T] alternatives like wlroots, and easier to use. it is also portable to
[T] linux, freebsd, netbsd, and openbsd.

